un passif estimé et des frais juridiques de 425 millions de dollars liés au litige Greensill, un élément exceptionnel qui a pesé sur le résultat opérationnel du trimestre.", "story_category": "Capital", "is_short_history": true, "_source": "10-Q avril 2026", "_source_file": "data-lake/MRSH/10Q/MRSH_2026-04-16.htm.gz", "_source_month": "avril 2026", "last_data_date": "2026-04-16", "_new_extraction_at": "2026-07-13T06:00:00Z"}, {"short": "mrsh-buyback-q1-2026", "name_fr": "Rachats d'actions T1 2026", "name_en": "Q1 2026 share buybacks", "value": 750, "unit": "M $", "yoy": 150, "type": "quarter", "nature": "flow", "signal": "Marsh McLennan racheté pour 750 M $ d'actions au T1 2026, +150% sur un an", "description": "Marsh McLennan a racheté 4,2 millions d actions pour 750 millions de dollars au premier trimestre 2026, contre 300 millions de dollars un an plus tôt, dans le cadre de l autorisation de 6 milliards de dollars approuvée en novembre 2025, laissant 4,9 milliards de dollars disponibles.", "story_category": "Capital", "is_short_history": true, "_source": "10-Q avril 2026", "_source_file": "data-lake/MRSH/10Q/MRSH_2026-04-16.htm.gz", "_source_month": "avril 2026", "last_data_date": "2026-04-16", "_new_extraction_at": "2026-07-13T06:00:00Z"}, {"short": "mrsh-consulting-segment-growth-q1-2026", "name_fr": "Croissance du segment Consulting", "name_en": "Consulting segment revenue growth", "value": 2558, "unit": "M $", "yoy": 11, "type": "quarter", "nature": "flow", "signal": "Revenu du segment Consulting en hausse de 11% à 2,56 Mds $", "description": "Le segment Consulting de Marsh McLennan, comprenant Mercer et Marsh Management Consulting, a généré un chiffre d affaires de 2,56 milliards de dollars au premier trimestre 2026, en hausse de 11%, avec un résultat opérationnel en progression à 525 millions de dollars.", "story_category": "Segments", "is_short_history": true, "_source": "10-Q avril 2026", "_source_file": "data-lake/MRSH/10Q/MRSH_2026-04-16.htm.gz", "_source_month": "avril 2026", "last_data_date": "2026-04-16", "_new_extraction_at": "2026-07-13T06:00:00Z"}, {"short": "marsh_risk_revenue_q", "name_fr": "Revenus Marsh Risk (courtage assurance)", "name_en": "Marsh Risk revenue", "unit": "M $", "period_type": "quarter", "history": [2352, 2876, 2546, 2778, 2470, 2711, 2744, 3038, 2700, 2896, 3003, 3265, 2934, 3334, 3453, 3849, 3400, 3664, 3726, 4071, 3849], "value": 3849, "last_data_date": "2026-09-02", "type": "Demand", "nature": "Structurel", "comparable": "Comparable", "signal": "Le courtage d'assurance Marsh Risk atteint 4 071 M $ au deuxième trimestre 2026, première activité du groupe.", "is_wow": true, "yoy": "+5,8 %"}], "stories_kpis": [], "ai_positioning": {"stance": "integrator", "summary": "Marsh McLennan déploie des outils d'IA transversalement, se dit exposé à la concurrence de nouveaux entrants utilisant l'IA générative et cite l'usage croissant de modèles génératifs (dont MCP Servers) dans ses systèmes internes.", "evidence": ["10-K Item 1: 'Mercer's...face competition from...new entrants utilizing generative AI.' L'entreprise reconnait explicitement le deploiement d'outils d'IA et la necessite de les 'deploy and utilize AI tools across different jurisdictions'.", "10-K Item 1A Cybersecurity: 'increasing use of generative AI models, including new capabilities offered through Model Context Protocol (MCP) Servers, in our internal systems' - integration active de modeles IA generatifs dans les systemes internes."], "doc_date": "2025-12-31", "source": "10-K exercice 2025 - MMC", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/62709/000006270926000022/mrsh-20251231.htm"}, "risks": [{"title": "Risques macroéconomiques et géopolitiques", "category": "Macro", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Multiple major wars, global conflicts, social unrest, tariffs, slower GDP growth or recession, FX fluctuations, interest rate changes, capital markets volatility and inflation could materially impact business, financial condition, results of operations and cash flows. Citation: \"Geopolitical and macroeconomic conditions, including from multiple major wars and global conflicts, social unrest, tariffs\". Position: bas Item 1A.", "trend": "up", "summary": "Macroeconomic and geopolitical environment including multiple major wars and global conflicts, social unrest, and tariffs represent significant risks to business performance", "score": 5, "title_en": "Macroeconomic and Geopolitical Risks"}, {"title": "Conformité réglementaire et évolution législative", "category": "Regulation", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Company cannot guarantee compliance with complex and evolving US federal, state and foreign laws and regulations; non-compliance could have material adverse effects; emerging AI-related laws add complexity. Citation: \"=== MRSH_2026-02-09.htm.gz === Item 1A ('Risk Factors' below for a discussion of how actions by\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "up", "summary": "Complex and evolving regulatory landscape including GDPR, CCPA, CPS 234, and emerging AI Act pose significant compliance risks and potential adverse effects on operations and reputation", "score": 5, "title_en": "Regulatory Compliance and Changing Laws"}, {"title": "Cybersécurité et protection des données", "category": "Cybersecurity", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Company handles sensitive client and customer data; breaches or failures to protect information systems could result in significant liability, reputational damage, and regulatory penalties. Citation: \"=== MRSH_2026-02-09.htm.gz === Item 1A ('Risk Factors' below for a discussion of how actions by\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "up", "summary": "Cybersecurity breaches or failures to protect client data and information systems could incur significant liability and damage to Company reputation and client trust", "score": 5, "title_en": "Cybersecurity and Data Protection"}, {"title": "Responsabilité fiduciaire et professionnelle", "category": "Operations", "severity": 5, "score_rationale": "Company is subject to significant uninsured exposures arising from errors and omissions, breach of fiduciary duty and other professional liability claims. Citation: \"We also delivered more than 400 in-person and virtual workshops, aimed at strengthening professional and\". Position: milieu Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Significant uninsured exposures from errors, omissions, breach of fiduciary duty and other professional liability claims could materially impact financial condition", "score": 5, "title_en": "Fiduciary and Professional Liability"}, {"title": "Competitive Pressures", "category": "Competition", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Company operates in competitive environment requiring differentiation to attract and retain clients; competition impacts market share and revenue growth. Citation: \"We offer our colleagues rewards designed to be competitive in the market, attract and retain\". Position: milieu Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Competitive environment may impact ability to maintain market share and achieve revenue growth targets", "score": 4}, {"title": "Dépendances tierces et conflits d'intérêts", "category": "Operations", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Business relies on third-party providers and introducers; inability to effectively identify and manage conflicts of interest could harm business and reputation. Citation: \"Certain insureds and groups of insureds have established programs of self-insurance as a supplement or\". Position: haut Item 1A.", "trend": "stable", "summary": "Reliance on third-party providers and challenges in managing actual and apparent conflicts of interest present operational risks", "score": 4, "title_en": "Third-Party Dependencies and Conflicts of Interest"}, {"title": "Risques réputationnels", "category": "Reputation", "severity": 4, "score_rationale": "Company's reputation as trusted advisor is critical to business; breaches, failures, o