and alternative risk financing services. This segment also offers insurance and reinsurance broking, strategic advisory and actuarial services, and analytics solutions. It serves businesses, public entities, insurance companies, associations, professional services organizations, and private clients. The Consulting segment provides health, wealth and career advice, solutions and products; and specialized management, strategic, economic, and brand consulting services. Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. was founded in 1871 and is headquartered in New York, New York.", "revenue_by_geography": {"label": "Répartition géographique du chiffre d'affaires (exercice 2025)", "slices": [{"name": "États-Unis", "label": "États-Unis", "label_en": "UNITED STATES", "value": 13.344, "share_pct": 49.3, "pct": 49.3, "unit": "Mds $"}, {"name": "Other Geographic Areas", "label": "Other Geographic Areas", "label_en": "Other Geographic Areas", "value": 9.899, "share_pct": 36.6, "pct": 36.6, "unit": "Mds $"}, {"name": "Royaume-Uni", "label": "Royaume-Uni", "label_en": "UNITED KINGDOM", "value": 3.816, "share_pct": 14.1, "pct": 14.1, "unit": "Mds $"}], "fiscal_year": "exercice 2025", "currency": "USD", "_source": "FMP revenue-geographic-segmentation FY2025 (2025-12-31) - SEC 10-K", "_fmp_extracted_at": "2026-07-13T07:00:00Z", "unit": "Mds $"}, "_haiku_seggeo_at": "2026-05-14T23:15:17.247220+00:00", "customer_type": {"primary": "B2B", "label": "Entreprises, institutions publiques et professionnels servis par les pôles risque, courtage d'assurance et conseil", "_source": "Sub-agent Claude 10-K"}, "_blocs_extracted_at": "2026-06-01T15:15:45Z", "_maj_by": "Sub-agent Opus MAJ chunk-08", "_maj_at": "2026-06-01T21:15:54Z", "_hero_change_failed_reason": "pas de serie Revenue >=16 trims jusqu en 2025+ | QHE: hero_kpi_short='Marsh Risk Revenue' is_rev_src=True len=11 last_year=2026 | SKI revenue_q: len=0 last_year=None", "_hero_change_failed_by": "Sub-agent Opus hero-fix-retry chunk-16", "_old_hero": "Ma